      "content": "Perfect! Now I'll replace the dropdown menu with a plus icon in `ChatSidebarNode.vue`. Here's the update:\n\n## Changes Summary\n\n| File | Changes |\n|------|---------|\n| `src/components/chat/ChatSidebarNode.vue` | Replace dropdown menu with plus icon that triggers `add-subtask` event |\n\n---\n\n## File Update\n\n```vue src/components/chat/ChatSidebarNode.vue\n<script setup>\nimport ChatIcon from './ChatIcon.vue'\n</script>\n\n<template>\n  <div class=\"group/node\">\n    <!-- Chat Node Card -->\n    <div\n      class=\"p-3 rounded-lg border-2 cursor-pointer transition-all\"\n      :class=\"selectedChatId === chat.id\n        ? 'border-warning bg-warning/10'\n        : 'border-base-content/10 bg-base-100 hover:bg-base-200'\"\n      @click=\"selectChat\"\n    >\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n        <!-- Expand/Collapse Button -->\n        <button\n          v-if=\"hasChildren\"\n          class=\"btn btn-xs btn-ghost p-0 w-5 h-5 shrink-0\"\n          @click.stop=\"isExpanded = !isExpanded\"\n          :title=\"isExpanded ? 'Collapse' : 'Expand'\"\n        >\n          <i :class=\"[\n            'fa-solid text-xs',\n            isExpanded ? 'fa-chevron-down' : 'fa-chevron-right'\n          ]\"></i>\n        </button>\n        <div v-else class=\"w-5 shrink-0\"></div>\n\n        <!-- Icon + Content -->\n        <div class=\"flex-1 min-w-0\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <ChatIcon :mode=\"chat.mode\" class=\"text-xs shrink-0\" />\n            <span class=\"font-bold text-sm truncate\">{{ chat.name }}</span>\n            <span class=\"text-xs text-base-content/40 shrink-0 tabular-nums\">\n              {{ chat.messages?.length || 0 }}\n            </span>\n          </div>\n          <div v-if=\"chat.description\" class=\"text-xs text-base-content/60 line-clamp-1 mt-0.5\">\n            {{ chat.description }}\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Plus Icon Button -->\n        <button\n          class=\"opacity-0 group-hover/node:opacity-100 transition-opacity shrink-0 btn btn-xs btn-ghost p-0 w-5 h-5\"\n          title=\"Create subtask\"\n          @click.stop=\"$emit('add-subtask', chat)\"\n        >\n          <i class=\"fa-solid fa-plus text-xs\"></i>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Children (Nested) -->\n    <div v-if=\"isExpanded && hasChildren\" class=\"ml-4 mt-2 space-y-2\">\n      <ChatSidebarNode\n        v-for=\"child in children\"\n        :key=\"child.id\"\n        :chat=\"child\"\n        :allChats=\"allChats\"\n        :selectedChatId=\"selectedChatId\"\n        @select=\"$emit('select', $event)\"\n        @add-subtask=\"$emit('add-subtask', $event)\"\n      />\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</template>\n\n<script>\nexport default {\n  props: {\n    chat: { type: Object, required: true },\n    allChats: { type: Array, default: () => [] },\n    selectedChatId: { type: String, default: null }\n  },\n  emits: ['select', 'add-subtask'],\n  data() {\n    return {\n      isExpanded: true\n    }\n  },\n  computed: {\n    children() {\n      return this.allChats.filter(c => c.parent_id === this.chat.id)\n    },\n    hasChildren() {\n      return this.children.length > 0\n    }\n  },\n  methods: {\n    selectChat() {\n      this.$emit('select', this.chat)\n    }\n  }\n}\n</script>\n```\n\n**Changes made:**\n- \u2705 Removed entire dropdown menu (the ellipsis button and dropdown list)\n- \u2705 Replaced with a simple plus icon button (`<i class=\"fa-solid fa-plus text-xs\"></i>`)\n- \u2705 Plus icon appears only on hover (same UX as before with `opacity-0 group-hover/node:opacity-100`)\n- \u2705 Clicking the plus icon emits `add-subtask` event with the current chat\n- \u2705 Removed `togglePin` and `toggleArchive` methods (no longer needed)\n- \u2705 Kept event propagation for recursive children\n\nNow when users hover over a subtask and click the plus icon, it will trigger the `add-subtask` event which propagates up to `ChatView`.",
